  },
  {
    "__type__": "cc.Label",
    "_name": "",
    "_objFlags": 0,
    "__editorExtras__": {},
    "node": {
      "__id__": 57
    },
    "_enabled": true,
    "__prefab": {
      "__id__": 61
    },
    "_visFlags": 0,
    "_customMaterial": null,
    "_srcBlendFactor": 2,
    "_dstBlendFactor": 4,
    "_color": {
      "__type__": "cc.Color",
      "r": 165,
      "g": 96,
      "b": 13,
      "a": 255
    },
    "_string": "I. Interface & Objective\n\nObjective: By continuously pairing up identical fruits, merge them into higher-level fruits within a limited number of moves to achieve the highest possible score, ultimately filling all positions around the outer ring to form a complete circle.\n\nII. Gameplay Process\n\n1.Tap any fruit on the outer ring — that fruit will be \"picked up\" and moved to the center of the screen.\n2.Tap another identical fruit on the outer ring — the fruit in the center will fly to that position, and the two identical fruits will merge into one new, larger fruit.\n3.Repeat the above steps until the outer ring is completely filled with fruits, at which point the game ends.\n\nIII. Merge Rules\n\n1.Only two fruits of the same type can be merged.\n2.When two identical fruits are merged, they produce a new fruit of a higher level (a \"larger fruit\").\n\nIV. Scoring System\n\n1.Each successful merge awards points. The higher the level of the resulting fruit, the more points awarded for that single merge.\n2.All points are cumulatively added together to form the final score.",
    "_horizontalAlign": 0,
    "_verticalAlign": 0,
    "_actualFontSize": 20,
    "_fontSize": 20,
    "_fontFamily": "Arial",
    "_lineHeight": 26,
    "_overflow": 3,
    "_enableWrapText": true,
    "_font": null,
    "_isSystemFontUsed": true,
    "_spacingX": 0,
    "_isItalic": false,
    "_isBold": true,
    "_isUnderline": false,
    "_underlineHeight": 2,
    "_cacheMode": 0,
    "_id": ""
